{
  "name": "computer_keypress",
  "description": "Press and release one non-character key in the runtime, such as enter, tab, escape or an arrow key. For ordinary text use computer_type; for combinations like ctrl+c use computer_hotkey. A modifier on its own (ctrl, alt, shift, win) is not accepted; press it together with another key through computer_hotkey.",
